<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="hero-img st-dynamic-693-2" style="width: 100%;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/3-ways-to-support-education-agents-in-a-shifting-international-education-landscape?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q4" target="_blank" style="display: block;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="640" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/hxdmry7z0b/en_us/images/6757967d8d088-1733793405.5777.jpg" alt="image blog" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 640px; max-width: 100%;" /> </a></td> 
