<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-693-6"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Empowering Agents to Navigate the Changing International Education Landscape</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">The international education landscape is evolving, as highlighted in the ICEF Agent Voice Report co-sponsored by Flywire. Students are now prioritizing visas, affordability, and work opportunities over traditional factors like institutional reputation.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">As an agent, you play a key role in guiding institutions through these shifts. Here’s how you can support your partnered universities:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #223341;">Provide insights on agent training and resources—valued by 86% of agents for staying ahead in the changing market.</span></li> 
<li style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #223341;">Encourage streamlined application processes to reduce processing times and improve communication with students and agents.</span></li> 
<li style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #223341;">Advocate for localized, transparent payment platforms that simplify transactions, ensuring stress-free and timely solutions for students.</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">Share these actionable steps with your institution partners to help them adapt and thrive.&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341;">For more insights, read the full </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/3-ways-to-support-education-agents-in-a-shifting-international-education-landscape?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q4"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>blog post</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #223341;">.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
