<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Flywire is excited to welcome the <strong>Education Centre of Australia (ECA)</strong> to our Global Enterprise Account portfolio. Since 2004, ECA has been a leader in education, offering diverse programs through university-managed campuses, Higher Education, VET, ELICOS, Internships, Professional Year and online initiatives across Australia and worldwide, helping thousands of students succeed.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><em>“We are always striving to enhance our processes, and the Flywire Accept &amp; Pay solution in StudyLink stood out immediately. I’m excited to see the benefits after go-live, particularly reduced turnaround times, increased transparency and a better, faster experience for students and agents.”</em> - Lee Kennedy-Davidson, Chief of Staff at ECA</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">This partnership enables seamless management of applications and payments globally, improving efficiency and user experience for students and agents worldwide.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">ECA’s offerings include campuses with:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>University of the Sunshine Coast, Adelaide</li> 
<li>Victoria University, Brisbane and Sydney</li> 
<li>University of Tasmania, Melbourne Study Centre</li> 
<li>University of Canberra Sydney Hills</li> 
<li>London Metropolitan University, London</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://eca.edu.au/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q4"><span style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;">Explore all ECA brands at</span> <strong><u>eca.edu.au.</u></strong></span></a></p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
