</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #fcfeff;">From November 1, 2024, to February 28, 2025, earn up to <strong>24% commission on all Medibank &amp; AHM OSHC policy</strong> sales through the Flywire Agent Platform. No action needed but you need to be an active Agent Platform user with an OSHC agreement. Maximize your revenue during this limited-time offer! For questions or details, contact us at <span style="color: #48b985;"><a style="color: #48b985;" href="mailto:agent.solution@flywire.com"><strong><u>agent.solution@flywire.com</u></strong></a></span>. Don’t miss out!</span></p> </td> 
